{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook","id":918857,"title":"Ang's Exalted Sketchbook","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-21T17:01:45-07:00","id":918857,"title":"Ang's Exalted Sketchbook","content":"I figured I'd start up a sketchbook thread for my Exalted art for those who wanted to keep up with it. That way, my art won't get lost in the main art share thread and it'll be easier to get feedback.<br /> <br /> - <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLq9uM9z1_Qz5Knz1eojzmrAaBnYSrdxnQ\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Inspiration Playlist</a><br /> - <a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/angelicshadow/chosen-of-the-unconquered-sun/?etslf=3667&amp;eq=chosen\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Inspiration Pinterest Board</a><br /> - <a href=\"http://www.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Art Site</a><br /> - <a href=\"http://angelasasser.deviantart.com\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantART Gallery</a><br /> <br /> First up, the cover art (uncropped and cropped versions) for <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">a fanfic</a> featuring my Eclipse Caste, Kalara Vadras.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://orig00.deviantart.net/74c6/f/2016/146/0/b/0b9525d1db2a08544ef0c86f93b0c0e0-da3veg3.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://orig10.deviantart.net/47ea/f/2016/146/5/e/the_uncrucified_wattpad_cover_by_angelasasser-da3ux3g.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> A video of how I made the cover art:<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/DlVumk3oAO4\" data-code=\"DlVumk3oAO4\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/DlVumk3oAO4/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> More sketches of Kalara of her disguise as Koh (on the left) and herself (on the right). Showcasing her look as a gunslinging Righteous Devil.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://pre04.deviantart.net/cba2/th/pre/i/2016/068/f/1/koh_vs_kalara_by_angelasasser-d9uk73g.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":11990,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","user":"angelicshadow","date":". 06-22-2016, 03:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":21}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-21T17:09:57-07:00","id":918862,"title":"","content":"Sketches for my Circle's Dawn Caste, Cathak Demiato. Featuring her low level gear and sketches for Power Armor. I'm still exploring the look of Power Armor. These all look too mundane, thus far).<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://orig00.deviantart.net/675e/f/2016/173/9/7/demiatofirstsketch_by_angelasasser-da79dgp.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\