ment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-22T07:59:03-07:00","id":1106546,"title":"","content":"I dig your use of color and texture! It's also cool to see the bits of your under-drawing peeking through beneath the lineart in your WIP. There are some perspective issues, but overall your work is very strong.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13057-anathemouse","name":"Anathemouse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13057_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T09:41:05-07:00","id":1113775,"title":"","content":"Thanks <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13057-anathemouse\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar13057_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"13057\" data-vbnamecard=\"13057\">Anathemouse</a>! Weapons and armor are still a weak point of mine, but drawing Exalted stuff has been a great challenge to help me improve.<br /> <br /> Also while I'm here, I recently put together a guide to Gem to help me write and draw with more of a unified mental image in mind for my story and characters in<br /> <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Uncrucified</a>. You can read the full blog post with my thoughts on visual themes of the area <a href=\"http://theuncrucifiedreaders.blogspot.com/2017/07/visual-guide-city-of-gem.html\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. <div align=\"center\"><i><a href=\"http://theuncrucifiedreaders.blogspot.com/2017/07/visual-guide-city-of-gem.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-6cFgxcOdQdI/WV5ewQa3ZPI/AAAAAAAACQM/Ez56B_z8H1o4cCAZuaC1Q_a_C7KAs5dZQCLcBGAs/s640/Visual%2BGuide%2B-%2BCity%2Bof%2BGem%2B1.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://theuncrucifiedreaders.blogspot.com/2017/07/visual-guide-city-of-gem.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-5pTAgH7JoW4/WV5l6AJUuSI/AAAAAAAACQk/pCT9vf6393Qruk96OrVzqua10REvt6ghgCLcBGAs/s640/Visual%2BGuide%2B-%2BCity%2Bof%2BGem%2B2.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> </a></i></div> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":11990,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","user":"angelicshadow","date":". 07-09-2017, 12:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T10:00:43-07:00","id":1113780,"title":"","content":"Also while I'm here. Enjoy some in-progress clothing concepts I've been chipping away at for Kalara from <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Uncrucified</a>! I streamed a little bit of my work on this over on <a href=\"http://www.twitch.tv/angelasasser\" target=\"_blank\">my Twitch</a>, if anyone's curious and wants to join me the next time I stream Exalted art. The recording of the wardrobe drawing is up on YouTube <a href=\"https://youtu.be/nXFhnuz9V-w\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/216414290725437441/333652671234048002/wardrobe-kalara-wip.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-11T11:30:48-07:00","id":1114686,"title":"","content":"Another sketch card of Rage-Halo's Syn! I wanted to show off his infernal inspired totemic aura, as he is an Exalted demon-blooded character.<br /> <br /> If you'd like a card like this, I still have slots available on <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/angelasasser\" target=\"_blank\">my Patreon</a> for them.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://img06.deviantart.net/6b4e/i/2017/192/8/0/patreon_sketch_card__totemic_mask_by_angelasasser-dbed0rt.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-21T21:17:02-07:00","id":1119173,"title":"","content":"I'm -still- working on design variations for Kalara's casual look and have done a few more than have been pictured here (of this spread, a mix of 3 and 4 is in the running right now). It's been fun wind down for my Thursday nights on <a href=\"http://www.twitch.tv/angelasasser\" target=\"_blank\">Twitch</a>!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://orig01.deviantart.net/f02e/f/2017/194/d/b/casualkalara_by_angelasasser-dbg8tvb.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> You can catch the video recording of my latest stream of me working on these concepts, plus a lot of rambling about my character's botches, near death experience, and Sidereal relationships here:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/gzGQPAfbT-Q\" data-code=\"gzGQPAfbT-Q\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/gzGQPAfbT-Q/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-28T09:40:43-07:00","id":1121912,"title":"","content":"I streamed myself working on the line art of our circle's Night Caste last night! Plus rambled forever about how our Night Caste player is breaking the game. Enjoy! <div align=\"center\"><br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/H8qz1i4Xdwo\" data-code=\"H8qz1i4Xdwo\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/H8qz1i4Xdwo/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> <div align=\"center\">Here's my progress thus far. Still some refining to do!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://orig14.deviantart.net/3689/f/2017/209/c/9/line_up___night_locust_by_angelasasser-dbhzgjf.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-28T16:06:21-07:00","id":1122111,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>angelicshadow</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook?p=1119173#post1119173\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm -still- working on design variations for Kalara's casual look and have done a few more than have been pictured here (of this spread, a mix of 3 and 4 is in the running right now).</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, I quite like those. Personally, I'm partial to the halter wrap of #3, and the shawl and trousers of #5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-24T18:37:47-07:00","id":1133619,"title":"","content":"I finished up the painting of our Night Caste, Night Locust, that I have been working on during my live streams! You can read more about his backstory <a href=\"https://angelasasserart.tumblr.com/post/164562556969/here-we-have-the-first-of-a-series-of-character\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://img11.deviantart.net/3f17/i/2017/236/b/5/exalted_portrait__night_locust_by_angelasasser-dbl4bnf.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-25T21:18:06-07:00","id":1134039,"title":"","content":"Now that's cool as hell. Can't wait to see the rest of them!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-26T06:25:28-07:00","id":1134124,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"159\" data-vbnamecard=\"159\">Leetsepeak</a> with luck, they'll all come out as cool! Night Locust has set the bar REALLY high. XD","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-28T07:04:22-07:00","id":1134824,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>angelicshadow</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook?p=1133619#post1133619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I finished up the painting of our Night Caste, Night Locust, that I have been working on during my live streams! You can read more about his backstory <a href=\"http://&quot;https://angelasasserart.tumblr.com/post/164562556969/here-we-have-the-first-of-a-series-of-character&quot;\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://img11.deviantart.net/3f17/i/2017/236/b/5/exalted_portrait__night_locust_by_angelasasser-dbl4bnf.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div>This is wonderful. I feel like the boot on the back leg should be higher than the boot on the front leg, based on the perspective of the belt and the shoulders. I love the hand gesture and the sigils on the Scythe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13057-anathemouse","name":"Anathemouse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13057_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-29T05:28:21-07:00","id":1135132,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13057-anathemouse\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar13057_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"13057\" data-vbnamecard=\"13057\">Anathemouse</a> thanks! That's a fair critique. I might fix that up when I get the chance before I move on to the others. I think that hand pose is what sells this pose. The others aren't nearly as expressive, with the exception of my own character, perhaps (the gunslinger to Night Locust's right). I need to work on that!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-24T19:58:41-07:00","id":1143646,"title":"","content":"Finally finished my exploration of Kalara's casual clothing set! I wanted her to have a simple, yet stylish casual look that shows off her elegant taste. You can read more about my design thoughts for this character at <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/users/outgoing?http://theuncrucifiedreaders.blogspot.com/2017/09/concept-art-kalara-vadras-casual-set.html\" target=\"_blank\">my story blog</a>.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-4FBDW847QTY/WcuqEo7WmFI/AAAAAAAACZg/ZttE57gRVAgSRlzDCMWuZo5rX0c9HE2gACLcBGAs/s1600/Kalara-Casual-Set.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":11990,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","user":"angelicshadow","date":". 09-27-2017, 11:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T08:09:56-08:00","id":1167306,"title":"","content":"It was about time I dusted off this sketchbook thread of mine! The recent <a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/search/exalted+secret+santa\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Secret Santa</a> exchange inspired me to get a character sheet finished for my Eclipse, Kalara, AND also got a character portrait done for my Secret Santa partner. <br /> <br /> You can see detail shots and more of this sheet at <a href=\"https://www.artstation.com/artwork/yvBL3\" target=\"_blank\">my ArtStation</a>.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pre00.deviantart.net/0829/th/pre/f/2017/342/8/2/character_sheet___kalara_vadras__basic__by_angelasasser-dbvr95l.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> You can watch a time lapse of how I drew this sheet here:<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/DqwV1tGmKEg\" data-code=\"DqwV1tGmKEg\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/DqwV1tGmKEg/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> For my Secret Santa gift, I chose Specs, a Spectacled Owl Lunar belonging to <a href=\"http://fishcapades.deviantart.com\" target=\"_blank\">Fishcapades</a>. See detail shots and line art at <a href=\"https://theuncrucified.tumblr.com/post/168479337447/merry-calibration-to-my-exalted-secret-santa\" target=\"_blank\">my Exalted-themed </a><a href=\"https://theuncrucified.tumblr.com/post/168479337447/merry-calibration-to-my-exalted-secret-santa\" target=\"_blank\">tumblr</a>.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://orig00.deviantart.net/72bc/f/2017/346/b/8/b84892167b4b3316815bc2a604d1bc2d-dbwk6vc.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-13T08:43:49-08:00","id":1175763,"title":"","content":"Been meaning to scan this in for ages since I drew it back when we first started playing Exalted! Here's a page from my sketchbook with an early doodle of my Eclipse Caste, Kalara, when she first came into our Exalted game as Koh the Silver-Tongued Devil, Merchant Prince for a new upstart Guild and fugitive slave as her cover story.<br /> <br /> Her Pristine Guild's logo was originally the Old Realm for the letter &quot;G&quot; (for the Guild) with the Eclipse Caste mark graffitied over the Guild's original logo with gold paint. As her Guild grew, she added a phoenix to the banner, which was inspired by their first battle against the soldiers who showed up to take back other fugitive slaves she was protecting.<br /> <br /> Her new ally, a Twilight Caste sorceress, summoned a phoenix that flew over the battlefield, singing songs as he went, and burning through their enemies. Plus, a phoenix seems fitting for Kalara and her Guild, who have a philosophy of burning down the old to build things anew.<br /> <br /> Plus, my scribbly notes about NPCs and politics in our game at the time for flavor!<img src=\"https://orig00.deviantart.net/0ff5/f/2018/011/2/5/256a4ce5eefee0b87bbeedee08ed410a-dbznmju.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-25T09:33:09-07:00","id":1415429,"title":"","content":"Been a long while and I'm dusting off this thread with some new art AND a big announcement!<br /> <br /> \u200bFirst off, enjoy a couple of images I forgot to share here that I created for art exchanges that we hosted over at the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/WUutEMw\" target=\"_blank\">Forge of Wonders Discord Server</a> (a community for Exalted artist, writers, and makers). Starting with Han Thakthay, a Night Caste with a snake familiar for Gforce.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/491182842550812682/605812040753348618/Exchange---Han-Thakthay-FINAL.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Lhyon's Air Aspect, Tepet Zaal.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/491182842550812682/509913473501626388/Exalted-Exchange---Tepet-Zaal.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":11990,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","user":"angelicshadow","date":". 09-25-2020, 12:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-25T09:46:53-07:00","id":1415433,"title":"","content":"And now the BIG announcement! <b> I am declaring an Art Challenge for myself for the month of October</b>, which means prepare to see a slew of Exalted art from me! With the help of the Exalted Discord community, I've created a 30 topic challenge based on Exalted's themes. <br /> <br /> You can see the topic list plus read about how to keep up with my Challenge posts <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/introducing-my-41974463\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. I'll also be sharing my exploratory sketches and story notes for the topics a month early for <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/angelasasser\" target=\"_blank\">my Patreon Patrons</a>, so if you fancy supporting some Exalted art in October, feel free to pitch in at least $1 to see those posts there!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/481568210043273237/758728692733182012/Exalted-Art-Challenge-2020-Compilation.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Here are a few of the sketches I've already done for a tease of Favorite Caste, Age of Sorrows Incarnation, etc.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/481554431868141588/755823059604209694/unknown.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/481568210043273237/758728688321167420/EAC---Sketch-Preview-2.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> I'll be sure to come back later here with some compilations once they're done! Otherwise, they'll be more instantly shared on social media to my Exalted project's <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a> and <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.blogspot.com\" target=\"_blank\">Blog</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-06T12:36:08-07:00","id":1417040,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Exalted Art Challenge 1 - Favorite Caste</span></span></span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Probably not a surprise to most that know me that the Eclipse Caste is my favorite caste. Their symbolism as the 'center', the core that holds the Sun's form in balance as &quot;the Fifth Arm&quot; really spoke to me. Human connection through culture and trade also speaks to my own love of art and business.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">I decided to give this caste cartouche visual flair inspired by my Eclipse, Kalara Vadras, who hails from Gem.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">More on this topic's design at <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.blogspot.com/2020/10/exalted-art-challenge-topic-1-favorite.html\" target=\"_blank\">my project's blog</a>.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-cMeZ38l7Hi8/X3dQWnSzyxI/AAAAAAAADzc/kOZFWMNVVYURqMGZ8rthpO3ArdsOs51VwCLcBGAsYHQ/s1000/01---Favorite-Caste---Eclipse-Caste---lowres.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-07T08:55:02-07:00","id":1417150,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><b><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Exalted Art Challenge</span> - 2 - Regional Fashion</b></span></span></span></span><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><i>I wonder sometimes if I would even recognize myself back then. I still remember the soft light of Gem's crystals and the teeming underground marketplace that never slept. As a slave of Iblan, I was dressed in attire to represent the household of my master, an aging master goldsmith.</i></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><i>I owned no finery of my own, not even the bangles I wore which served as an example of Iblan craftmanship for all to see and admire, for even their slaves must convey everything about their stature as Gem's famed goldsmiths. Instead of gems sewn into my shawl as any fine lady of Gem might own, mine was painted and embroidered to mimic gems. I was a pale imitation of what a noble Iblan lady might be.</i></span></span></span></span></div><br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">- Memoirs of Kalara Vadras, The Uncrucified, RY 800.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Painted in Procreate. My Challenge has started of slowly, but sometimes you just have to run away with the Muse! I've been enjoying slowing down and exploring this topic.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Read the full write-up </span></span></span><a href=\"http://theuncrucified.blogspot.com/2020/10/exalted-art-challenge-2-regional-fashion.html\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-0kdpRMljt0A/X3yJETbXP5I/AAAAAAAAD0I/-0_Av3GTPo4Sr1Bm5PFDL_tKFbV-KrGYQCLcBGAsYHQ/s1000/EAC---Regional-Fashion.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-G_tUyikkeUI/X3yJESuU2FI/AAAAAAAAD0M/LMGkzUkunb0zWEmR1Jt6iOLCRDMvQrwZACLcBGAsYHQ/s1000/EAC---Regional-Fashion-Detail.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-15T21:37:56-07:00","id":1418477,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Exalted Art Challenge - 3 - Favorite Charm</span></b><br /> <br /> <i>The Righteous Devil form isn\u2019t merely a martial art, but a spiritual reckoning. When you draw on this art, you\u2019re pulling from that turmoil deep down, from all the sins you\u2019ve ever committed, and all the sinners you\u2019ve ever reckoned with. All that roiling guilt and anger and painful understanding refined and channeled into the flame of your soul, of your weapons.</i></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><i>It took me years to even begin to master it\u2026and it almost destroyed me. Only one who can understand their own sins can channel what it means to be not only a Devil, but a Righteous one.</i></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">- Memoirs of Kalara Vadras, The Uncrucified, RY 800.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">My entry for Favorite Charm for the Exalted Art Challenge is a rendition of the Righteous Devil charm, Garda Flies on Gilded Wings Attack. Kalara never got this far down the path of the RD, so it's a bit of wish fulfillment. I tried to make her aura sparkling and diaphanous like a solar eclipse. Painted entirely in Procreate.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>Read the full write-up <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.blogspot.com/2020/10/exalted-art-challenge-3-favorite-charm.html\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</b></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><img src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-wV6ITZQP950/X4Z6ZnwRs5I/AAAAAAAAD08/6gHYEahVV8YHrVcctjVhKVRiiBlGtJDggCLcBGAsYHQ/s1200/EAC_-_Favorite_Charm_Final-LOWRES.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-VialBwmWO-E/X4cVhyuqWTI/AAAAAAAAD1U/JOULRHbdL149m1tTnMcM_e5PuLDa5wIWQCLcBGAsYHQ/s1001/EAC_-_Favorite_Charm_Final-DETAIL.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":11990,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","user":"angelicshadow","date":". 10-16-2020, 12:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-16T10:16:59-07:00","id":1418544,"title":"","content":"If you fancy supporting Exalted art on Patreon during this Art Challenge, I've been sharing my Exalted Art Challenge sketches with creative notes a month early for my Patrons! You can find the first two compilations here. Each one collects more images and discussion at the links:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/exalted-art-1-42524323\" target=\"_blank\">Collection 1</a> - Exploring Favorite Caste, Favorite Charm, and Regional Fashion for Gem.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://c10.patreonusercontent.com/3/eyJwIjoxfQ%3D%3D/patreon-media/p/post/42524323/f44e65cd0e2e4b4c9e212f9c4bfa4ffe/1.jpg?token-time=1604077192&amp;token-hash=wL02Pm85SEwIiNMf6hG5rATcohWPHmINmzZWEgaabSc%3D\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/42786446\" target=\"_blank\">Collection 2</a> - Exploring the spell Death of Obsidian Butterflies, House Cynis, and a mural dedicated to Luna.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://c10.patreonusercontent.com/3/eyJwIjoxfQ%3D%3D/patreon-media/p/post/42786446/c92ca3b1f76f4cdaa721dcb76252223a/1.jpg?token-time=1604077366&amp;token-hash=R24dewI4_ZvvUaof9oxjdQ6s9DcjwAILyTDTnfPnsZc%3D\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-22T15:11:53-07:00","id":1419655,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The 3rd compilation of sketches for my Exalted Art Challenge arrives early for Patreon Patrons! Exploring concepts for the God of Gambling, First Age heroes, and more. Here are some of my favorite picks, with alternate sketches and creative notes at </span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/43044185\" target=\"_blank\">the post</a><span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/43044185\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Su2VyW4ydcc/X5IAKywe6mI/AAAAAAAAD2Q/9veW9ev9l3M3aX3R1HV1HtRr9ZX4VoBvQCLcBGAsYHQ/s1920/zsjnle6pspu51%255B1%255D.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-22T16:06:01-07:00","id":1419670,"title":"","content":"PLUS enjoy a bonus sketch of the Plentimon of Dice's poker face. I had a good giggle imagining what he'd look like while playing a game. His innocuous inky form would make it very hard to read his tells!<br /> <div align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-D-hcMRe2U4E/X5INPEHhjrI/AAAAAAAAD2c/VXWOTRupoH00xbpwVgEGtLcA6sjL1-O2QCLcBGAsYHQ/s1000/unknown.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-30T08:54:06-07:00","id":1420986,"title":"","content":"Just in time for a spoopy weekend! My next Exalted Art Challenge sketch collection is up early for Patrons featuring Abyssals, the Deathlord the Lover Clad in the Raiment of Tears, and one of her monstrances.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/43312962\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://c10.patreonusercontent.com/3/eyJwIjoxfQ%3D%3D/patreon-media/p/post/43312962/9e0ece12bf7a421fb854ff3c26904c71/1.jpg?token-time=1605282548&amp;token-hash=ikQOxQAjFkgcwI2usORCGDIHduEjWa2GqR_PK1bEz8U%3D\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br /> <br /> <b>The preview features a few of my faves from the collection, with more art and creative notes at <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/43312962\" target=\"_blank\">the post</a>.</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":11990,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","user":"angelicshadow","date":". 10-30-2020, 05:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-03T08:44:35-08:00","id":1421628,"title":"","content":"I took a quick break from the Exalted Art Challenge to experiment with a new art style! Blood of Zeus had me all kinds of inspired for Exalted, so I thought I'd try drawing Kalara in this vein. Imagine my surprise to see that I think this is probably the best version of her I've done! It's captured something about her look that I think I've failed to do in other images.<br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Elxj2tTWkAAQJwR?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-04T08:37:06-08:00","id":1421801,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">The 1st batch of my Exalted Art Challenge concept sketches have come out of Patreon Early Access, so enjoy the flood of art! I'll be sharing one concept sheet per day till we're all caught up.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">These concepts for the topic <b>Favorite Caste </b>explore customizing a caste mark for my Eclipse, Kalara, who hails from Gem. As such, I wanted her sigil to have a desert flair to it and took much inspiration from Moroccan motifs.</span></span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">In the end, <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.blogspot.com/2020/10/exalted-art-challenge-topic-1-favorite.html\" target=\"_blank\">the final design</a> combines abstracted fire elements with the tails of the phoenix, a personal symbol of Kalara's.</span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> </span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/El6e8tMXUAATYQq?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-05T07:32:55-08:00","id":1422028,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><b>Exalted Art Challenge Concept Sketches - Regional Fashion</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Exploring the fashion of Gem, the underground mining metropolis in a volcano and Kalara's hometown. I went through different ideas for this one, from Kalara eating lunch in a hidden niche by a crystal (top right thumbnail) to a fancy version of her where she's returned to Gem as a wealthy Eclipse Caste and dresses in full finery for a party (top left thumbnail).</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">I opted for the simple glimpse of her in the market almost purely so I could draw that fun purse and explore fashion textures, as well as show a peek of her early life. I really like that lunch concept though, so might have to work that up sometime!<br /> <br /> You can see the final art for this one <a href=\"https://theuncrucified.blogspot.com/2020/10/exalted-art-challenge-2-regional-fashion.html\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</span></span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/El_i1DUXIAMrrM-?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-06T08:26:28-08:00","id":1422252,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><b>Exalted Art Challenge Concepts for Fave Charm</b></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The concepts for Favorite Charm gave me a chance to explore the many glorious flame FX of the Celestial firepower of a Righteous Devil like Kalara. It also granted a bit of wish fulfillment since she never learned Garda Flies on Gilded Wing Attack.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">These FX are just SCREAMING to be animated and are giving me more incentive to learn animation in Procreate! I'm saving the top right thumbnail of Cloud of Ebon Devils for a cover piece because it just has presence! Future cover of a sequel story to The Uncrucified, perhaps? Or at least some cool promo art!</span></span></span><br /> <img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/8ca3c796-5c30-4408-abd4-b74458ddd2a3/de87mwc-f29f29c7-1c89-4a2f-aba4-52a97670846e.jpg?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ1cm46YXBwOiIsImlzcyI6InVybjphcHA6Iiwib2JqIjpbW3sicGF0aCI6IlwvZlwvOGNhM2M3OTYtNWMzMC00NDA4LWFiZDQtYjc0NDU4ZGRkMmEzXC9kZTg3bXdjLWYyOWYyOWM3LTFjODktNGEyZi1hYmE0LTUyYTk3NjcwODQ2ZS5qcGcifV1dLCJhdWQiOlsidXJuOnNlcnZpY2U6ZmlsZS5kb3dubG9hZCJdfQ.KZLfOxXek3cknvJYRGmHR4rV7OZfFWvK_qmtJIyKisU\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":11990,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","user":"angelicshadow","date":". 11-06-2020, 11:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-07T15:17:28-08:00","id":1422501,"title":"","content":"A two-fer today so I could catch my forum peeps up to my most recent posts!<br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><b>Exalted Art Challenge Concept Sketches - Favorite Dragonblooded House</b><br /> </span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">I chose House Cynis who feature in The Uncrucified in the form of gambling addict and bathhouse owner, Cynis Varia, and his wife, Sana, the daughter of an outcaste Wood Aspect who married into the family, since nobody else of status wanted to take on Varia's extreme debt and bad habits. The two are a strangely tender and terrible couple in a world of arranged marriages.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">This sheet explores portraits of Varia and Sana as well as a house sigil emblazoned by a bonsai, since their associated element is Wood. Their house motto reads &quot;Wood Nourished on Tears of the Fallen&quot;.</span></span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EmJ77QdW0AUsZ7g?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Exalted Art Challenge Concept Sketches - Favorite Spell</span></span></span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">There was no contest in choosing a fave spell. How could I resist a spell that sends razor sharp obsidian butterflies flying out of the caster's hands? It's so goth extra and I love it! If a sorcerer chooses this spell as their specialty, they can also grow slashing claws of obsidian.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">I made this character up on the fly as a sorcerer-assassin, of sorts. Instead of the more proper elegant mages, I imagine this nameless mage to be much more world-weary and cold. She would fit in well with the Guild assassins that Kalara will no doubt clash with later on in her story!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EmPYkhtXEAIQYlF?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-08T07:45:17-08:00","id":1422593,"title":"","content":"<b>Exalted Art Challenge Concept Sketches - Favorite Incarnae - Luna</b><br /> <br /> I chose the Incarnae, Luna, goddess of the moon in Exalted for this topic. The Changing Maiden is all things, trickster, lover, prankster, and so much more. Her capricious nature appeals to my favorite trickster stories.<br /> <br /> For her concept, I explored what a mural might look like in her temple, eventually favoring an asymmetrical version that felt more organic and freeform, which suited her themes better than the orderly symmetrical concepts. The masks represent her shapeshifting identities, with moon phases and rabbit companions worked into her motifs.<br /> <br /> Keen-eyed fans might also pick up the inspiration I took from the Diamond murals in Steven Universe. Out of the topics so far, this is one of my favorites I want to bring to finish!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://c10.patreonusercontent.com/3/eyJwIjoxfQ%3D%3D/patreon-media/p/post/42786446/137fae4b6f7441cdbb548eac2de27f71/1.jpg?token-time=1606058384&amp;token-hash=ZNlm5r16VYJ0QXEr1DAzoX2BJKEQQ-urCDh4mojZY7Y%3D\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":11990,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","user":"angelicshadow","date":". 11-08-2020, 11:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-08T16:09:28-08:00","id":1422672,"title":"","content":"I'm a fan of your design for the Lover. It has a lot more style to it than the official one.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>angelicshadow</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook?p=1422501#post1422501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I made this character up on the fly as a sorcerer-assassin, of sorts. Instead of the more proper elegant mages, I imagine this nameless mage to be much more world-weary and cold. She would fit in well with the Guild assassins that Kalara will no doubt clash with later on in her story!</div> </div> </div> </div> I like her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-09T09:15:28-08:00","id":1422754,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><b>Exalted Art Challenge Concept Sketches - Favorite God - Plentimon of the Dice</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Creation is full of offerings a-plenty for the Plentimon of the Dice! He is the God of Gambling and one of the most present and active gods in Creation. This god gets a thrill from watching games of chance unfold and the excitement of high stakes. He's always circulating Creation visiting every casino either in his full splendor or a mortal disguise. Those who gamble to him and lose without repaying their debts meet mysterious unexplained deaths.</span></span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">The Plentimon shows up often in The Uncrucified, as Kalara's hometown of Gem hosts one of the most magnificent subterranean gambling parlors built with such finery as to please the gods themselves. Games of chance are part of the culture of Gem, with fortunes always turning in their many gambling dens. Kalara has experienced this firsthand as her contract was lost several times in a game of chance, usually during Plentimon's festival day.</span></span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">I've chosen to depict the Plentimon with a half-mask representing Good and Bad fortune with jewelry and adornments made from various game pieces and jade obols. Perhaps they are the good luck charms from those who have lost to him?</span></span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EmZNjlCW4AInsej?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-09T13:39:52-08:00","id":1422819,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook?p=1422672#post1422672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm a fan of your design for the Lover. It has a lot more style to it than the official one.<br /> <br /> I like her.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey thanks! She was a particularly inspirational figure for me. I got a lot of cool mental images from her description before I ever saw her art and was very much looking forward to the Deathlord topic for this reason. Can't wait to draw more of her! I suspect she'll show up in my Exalted fiction too, at this rate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-10T11:23:00-08:00","id":1422925,"title":"","content":"<b>Exalted Art Challenge Concept Sketches - First Age Incarnation</b> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">In each spark of Exaltation resides a Shard which is passed down from one worthy vessel to another. This gent here is Calym Lang, the Solar and Righteous Devil practitioner whose shard Kalara would eventually inherit.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Calym was a shrewd and paranoid master of trade whose cold pragmatism would be his downfall. Kalara is more like him than she would like to admit at times and the two maintain a begrudging respect towards one another. She often communicates with his greater soul in the underworld, the two poking fun at each other's flaws in a good-natured competition to see who will achieve their goals through more effective ends.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">He's also ghostwritten a series of erotica novels that Kalara is a fan of, but will never tell him.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Calym's mural venerates his status as one who united the four corners of Creation, all trade routes leading to the compass in his hand. I imagine this to be the centerpiece of a wider mural, each region of the mural depicting the exports of the area they represent (an image our Storyteller described once that never left my mind).</span></span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EmehE_1XUAA5Hzn?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-11T01:27:38-08:00","id":1423028,"title":"","content":"I love the peacock or phoenix or whatever that is above his head!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=54\" data-tempid=\"temp_54_1416905226263_414\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/817-hakushaku","name":"Hakushaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar817_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-11T09:37:40-08:00","id":1423071,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hakushaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook?p=1423028#post1423028\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I love the peacock or phoenix or whatever that is above his head!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thank you! It's a silver phoenix and Kalara has a gold one just like it, which I'm sharing today!<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><b>Exalted Art Challenge Concept Sketches - Age of Sorrows Incarnation - Kalara Vadras</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">When the Exalted of the First Age fell, the Age of Sorrows began, but a glimmer of hope stands on the horizon. The Shards of the Exalted have begun to appear again, imbuing heroes like Kalara with the power to change the face of Creation.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Like Calym, I've depicted her in a mural style with some key differences. While Calym's focuses on veneration from his worshippers, Kalara stands among people who rise up in revolution carrying tools of their trade, as she spends much of her power in Creation empowering escaped slaves like herself with trade skills and fostering fair economy through her organization, the Pristine Guild.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">She struggles between the Gun and the Quill, violence and diplomacy. By the end of her time in Creation, she will have learned to balance both.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">She and Calym share the phoenix as a personal symbol, though they oppose each other in gold and silver.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Emj1AMEWEAAlVNd?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span></span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> A side by side comparison of Kalara and Calym's temple murals showing their opposing silver and gold phoenixes.<br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Emj-CIBWEAMKaUF?format=jpg&amp;name=900x900\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":11990,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","user":"angelicshadow","date":". 11-11-2020, 01:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-12T18:10:48-08:00","id":1423427,"title":"","content":"<b>Exalted Art Challenge - Incarnations Back to Back - Kalara and Calym</b><br /> <br /> Now that Calym's design is finally defined, this topic let me explore just how badass two Righteous Devils can be!<br /> <br /> While Calym's time is over, he and Kalara remain inextricably bound. His Shard has also passed on some of his memories and knowledge. Kalara strives to learn from the mistakes Calym made and the emotionless spirit construct of himself he has left behind to tutor her in bureaucracy.<br /> <br /> Should she ever prove unworthy, however, Calym has made his intentions known that he will destroy her so that a more worthy successor might come along more quickly, a threat Kalara never takes seriously.<br /> <br /> The left thumbnail is another one I hope to bring to final! I'm loving their poses!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EmoxuOJWMAEjD4w?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> --<br /> <br /> If you want to help support me as an artist AND get a look at the sketches before everyone else, you can pitch into <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/angelasasser\" target=\"_blank\">my Patreon</a> and see the newest compilations <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/exalted-art-5-43837604\" target=\"_blank\">there</a>! (I've just posted a new one today that won't go public until next month.)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/exalted-art-5-43837604\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://scontent.fatl1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/125303445_10164393221745285_3568027432505907131_o.jpg?_nc_cat=109&amp;ccb=2&amp;_nc_sid=730e14&amp;_nc_ohc=u7nXmZaNqR4AX9gneCm&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fatl1-1.fna&amp;oh=81d7a24a72e91261ca75807266dd23c7&amp;oe=5FD433AF\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":11990,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","user":"angelicshadow","date":". 11-12-2020, 09:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-13T10:02:32-08:00","id":1423583,"title":"","content":"Now we're getting into the fun spoopy topics of the Exalted Art Challenge I was looking forward to the most! Feels great to indulge my inner Goth Girl.<br /> <br /> <b>Abyssal - Golden Lies Spewn Forth From Avarice</b><br /> <br /> In life, Golden Lies obsessed over material wealth and pursued it to his end. In death (or undeath), he cloaks himself in the finery of a king's funeral adorned with bejeweled bones and serves the Deathlords, the Lover Clad in the Raiment of Tears. <br /> <br /> I played with a couple of different color schemes for him and am favoring the white-haired look at the moment! This isn't the last we'll see of this fellow, as he might appear in The Uncrucified down the line, if the story goes where I think it's going.<br /> <br /> On the bottom-right, I also decided to draw fan art of another Abyssal who I liked the design of, the Saint of Promised Silence, who belongs to HamSamLich. Be sure not to be too loud in cemeteries around her!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Emt5m4yXMAEQe9g?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T10:18:18-08:00","id":1423772,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>Exalted Art Challenge Concept Sketches - Deathlord - The Lover</b></span><br /> <br /> For this topic, I couldn't resist choosing the Lover Clad in the Raiment of Tears. While other Deathlords challenge Creation with armies and violence, she works indirectly through manipulation, a clever, patient predator.<br /> <br /> I wove the 'tears' of the Lover's name into her design, her dangling jewels mimicking falling streams of tears and the makeup on her face flowing like tear streaks punctuated by a drip of 'blood' from her lips. The tear shape even echoes in the cutout in her dress. For a seductress as high caliber as the Lover, I wanted a sense of high class, of ornamentation. She has bare shoulders to show a tantalizing bit of skin and smokes an opium pipe, which to me embodies her motif of 'luxurious destruction'.<br /> <br /> She really seems to agree with the muse! I am definitely planning to choose one of her thumbnails to turn into a full painting.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EmzV6YDW4AA39_d?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":11990,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","user":"angelicshadow","date":". 11-14-2020, 01:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-15T12:39:21-08:00","id":1424069,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">With this next sketch page, I'm officially done posting until the next batch of sketches come out Early Access! </span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">If you want to support an artist and see the sketches before everyone else, you can <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/angelasasser\" target=\"_blank\">join my Patreon</a>.<br /> <br /> <b>Exalted Art Challenge Concept Sketches - Monstrance - &quot;Arms of the Lover&quot;</b></span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">As each monstrance suits the Deathlord's intentions (the way I interpret the lore), I've chosen to portray this monstrance controlled by the Lover Clad in the Raiment of Tears as being much like its owner. The silk satin pillowing inside makes it seem like a luxurious bed, the soulsteel and jade construct gilded with gold.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">A prismatic crystalline lid allows one to gaze on the poor soul inside, whose body is trapped in an arc that mimics ecstasy by gold caressing arms that come alive and clasp the victim within. Inserted along the crystal lid, jewel encrusted needles stab into each of the victim's chakra points, plying the Solar within for corruption. Like the Lover, this monstrance combines a beautiful and terrible aesthetic.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Here's a cropped SFW preview:<br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Em4Xy2kXcAQBETI?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> And a spoiler-tagged full view that I'm hiding for suggestive themes, non-graphic body horror, and undetailed artistic nudity:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/--VFnnZ4v88U/X5uPKtlooMI/AAAAAAAAD24/uGctjljjjI8Ly0e-dafZ8_5uSQt9SiUxgCLcBGAsYHQ/s16000/Sketch-Compilation---Monstrance.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div></span></span></span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-19T14:18:06-08:00","id":1425012,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The 6th Exalted Art Challenge </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">collection arrives a month early just for my Patrons! Featuring weapons, artifacts, warstriders, and magical materials. Check out the article for my creative notes, lore, and more unpublished art.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">PLUS, Patrons can help me name Kalara's warstrider! <br /> <br /> Once you join my Patreon, you can read the article <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/exalted-art-6-44047902\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EnN-OhqW8AEJwR_?format=jpg&amp;name=large\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span></span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-24T13:32:35-08:00","id":1426034,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Exalted Art Challenge</b> - Reaction When You Don't Take Sail</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I leaked this a little early on Discord, so gonna go ahead and share here too!</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">This one was inspired by the funny stories I heard when I first started playing Exalted. There was always 'that time we were trapped on a deserted island and nobody had thought to take Sail'. But in our Circle's case, at least my Eclipse, Kalara, had taken it.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Having a point in Sail means your pirate hat is automatically bigger than everyone else's. It is known! Though, in reality, Kalara only had two points in it, so she knew enough to maybe not die during a storm at sea.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">(I think Imma have to draw my gal, Kalara, there in that hat outfit sometime. It's a fun hat!)<br /> </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.redd.it/hvgvny8u89161.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-02T10:40:15-08:00","id":1427001,"title":"","content":"My next batch of Challenge topics are out of <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/angelasasser\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon </a>Early Access so I can finally share them here. Enjoy!<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>14 - Anima Banner</b></span><br /> <br /> Kalara expresses her banner with a phoenix that rises from behind her, signifying her own rise from the ashes of her would-be execution on the cross, which is alluded to in the golden spikes through her palms. Chains of energy appear on her arms and legs, the links falling off one by one as she 'unchains' herself from a mortal fate that would have kept her a slave.<br /> <br /> The phoenix wasn't in her original anima banner design, but I'm so happy I've added it for this new design. I can't imagine her without it, now!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EoQAyoFW8AM7zhj?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-03T18:31:52-08:00","id":1427238,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Exalted Art Challenge Sketches - Limit Break</b></span><br /> <br /> Wooo this is officially topic 15, the halfway point of the Challenge! I made it! <br /> <br /> <br /> Kalara's Great Curse manifests as a paranoia that her enemies are out to get her. She has nightmares of the night her father was poisoned, fearing that she, too, will meet the same fate he did in his battle against the Guild. She even starts to doubt her friends, who are the only people she's let close enough to assassinate her. <br /> <br /> <br /> In our campaign, I never saw her in this state, but I was always dreading it (and also relishing the roleplay opportunity). Perhaps it will happen in <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">her story</a> I've been writing, instead!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EoVDE7gXcAQn3CF?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-04T09:13:42-08:00","id":1427280,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Exalted Art Challenge - Reasons to Have Ox Body</b></span><br /> <br /> When you start playing Exalted, the book suggests taking a level or more of Ox Body so your freshly made character is just a bit more tanky in a world where people can punch gods in the face.<br /> <br /> <br /> Take Ox Body, they said! Not me. I started our game with Kalara having maybe one level of it, if any. I learned the hard way when a spoopy tree creature nearly one-shot my gal towards the beginning of our game.<br /> <br /> <br /> This is what happens when you ignite your bag of firedust on the tree spirit's face and get its undivided attention! It critical rolled and punched a hole right through my squishy Eclipse Caste. Our Night Caste, Night Locust, wasn't near this amused in-game, but I've dramatized the moment for comedic effect.<br /> <br /> <br /> And to add insult on top of injury, she still had to translate languages for everyone for the rest of the scene with a gaping hole in her torso.<br /> <br /> (If you're wondering why Kalara looks different, she was in disguise as Koh, a rebel bandit leader, early on in our game.)<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://preview.redd.it/d9e6m115d7361.jpg?width=960&amp;crop=smart&amp;auto=webp&amp;s=f8250cad9f92dfe1ff6ea99cc8710f4709ca7c4e\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-05T14:39:49-08:00","id":1427403,"title":"","content":"<b>Exalted Art Challenge Sketches - Magical Materials</b><br /> <br /> I'm less experienced with environment and object art, so I was excited to push my comfort zone with these next few topics! <br /> <br /> Solars resonate best with Orichalcum, gold that has been infused with the radiance of the Unconquered Sun, himself.<br /> <br /> For this topic, I explored different approaches to portraying this metal, from a manuscript page talking about the alchemical processes involving mystic mirrors you can use to create it to the natural quarries high in the mountains where the sun's radiance blesses the 'blood of the earth' (magma) to create naturally occurring orichalcum.<br /> <br /> I also chose a more Hindu-inspired depiction of the Unconquered Sun, as he's usually more Roman-inspired in the setting.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EogVNtmW4AQtHYs?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-06T13:11:44-08:00","id":1427486,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Exalted Art Challenge Sketches - Favorite Weapon - The Eyes of Lord Automeris</b></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">In one adventure, Kalara and her Circle of Solars faced off against their dark counterparts, the Abyssal Deathknights of the Walker in Darkness. Kalara's opponent in this battle was Crown of Thorns on the Head of the King Who Never-Was who wielded warfans.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Called the Eyes of Lord Automeris, when Crown of Thorns activated his weapon, the souls trapped in the soulsteel would writhe and wail silently on the surface while a conspicuously closed eye on the fans would open fully, revealing a terrible red eye that allowed him to impose his will on others, while also filling them with fear. The fans were inspired by the Automeris moth with its shocking eye markings that look like a starry sky.</span></span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#050505\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><br /> Thankfully, Kalara was able to use her strong will to shrug off Crown of Thorns' mental attack and end the Deathknight in a flurry of shots from her prayer piece guns before he could impose his will again. Despite their short battle, I never forgot the sheer coolness of this Deathknight's fans created by my Storyteller.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EokEDMgXEAE9L-5?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></span><br /> </span></span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-08T08:01:09-08:00","id":1427707,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Exalted Art Challenge Sketches - Warstrider</b></span><br /> <br /> We never discovered the Warstriders of our characters' First Age Incarnations in our campaign, so this was an opportunity to let my imagination run wild!<br /> <br /> The sketches explore moments in time, from Kalara discovering the warstrider enshrined in a hidden temple where she meditates to bond with it, to her finally being accepted by this sentient weapon.<br /> <br /> The warstrider itself was a very spontaneous design inspired by Kalara's connection to fire, the warstrider having fire hair and other elemental connections in its ornate swirls. I imagine in battle this warstrider sends her floating wings out for slashing damage or to use as a mechanism for ricocheting energy shots in normally impossible angles. She is as yet unnamed (I'm open to suggestions!)<br /> <br /> I had to stop myself from making more thumbnails because I can see so many more moments spent earning this warstrider's trust or other scenes of derelict warstriders blended with the low tech world that has sprung up around them.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://cdna.artstation.com/p/assets/images/images/032/777/110/large/angela-sasser-warstrider.jpg?1607442744\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-11T14:00:33-08:00","id":1428124,"title":"","content":"<br /> My next Exalted Art Challenge compilation has arrived a week early for Patrons! Explore imagery for a most unexpected Familiar, the mischievous Peacat, and more.<br /> <br /> See the full lore write-ups and more images for the topics at the post:<br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/44933499\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.patreon.com/posts/44933499<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Eo_O79RXUAAdR3j?format=jpg&amp;name=large\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-16T11:14:36-08:00","id":1428621,"title":"","content":"The next batch of Patreon Early Access art from the Challenge has gone public, so begin the next flood of Exalted Art Challenge topics!<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Familiar - Mice of the Sun</b></span><br /> <br /> I thought I'd end up drawing something flashy like a phoenix or some other impressive mystical animal, but the Mice of the Sun stole my heart because I enjoy the contrast of such a small creature with such loyalty to the Solar and unexpected power in their tiny forms.<br /> <br /> I decided to make the sun on their backs more prominent and to also give them a little flame shrew tail when they're using their powers.<img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EpTv7ITXMAUzzey?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-17T09:21:09-08:00","id":1428770,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>Exalted Art Challenge Sketches - Beastpeople</b></span><br /> <br /> I'm not very experienced in drawing animals, so this was a tough topic for me. It ended up being pretty fun, in the end!<br /> <br /> I couldn't resist drawing Beastpeople of the majestic Secretary Bird and a very fancy Orchid Mantis gal. (How many of you noticed her eyes are her hair buns?)<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EpX6QLVXIAQp1FE?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-19T15:52:14-08:00","id":1429085,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Exalted Art Challenge Sketches - Animal - The Peacat</span></b><br /> <br /> Now we have the mischievous Peacat, an original creature of my own creation! These fickle creatures prowl the streets of the city of Chiaroscuro at night stealing food and causing general mayhem. It is said they are beloved of Luna for their night-time activities and beauty, a connection echoed in the moonlike feather markings in their tails and crests.<br /> <br /> Local custom tells that if you leave food offerings for a Peacat, it could bring you luck and blessings. It could just as easily make a home of your dwelling where your most beautiful things may end up destroyed because the Peacat would prefer to be the most beautiful thing there. Either way, better to have a Peacat's favor than naught! However, it is a sin against Luna to try to domesticate them.<br /> <br /> The Delzhan honor these creatures too, for once upon a time, a Peacat led the Tri-Khan's ancestors out of a night-time storm in the desert, even if some say it was because of the promise of food from the caravan.<br /> <br /> Though they can be a menace, they are accepted as a fact of city life.<br /> <br /> <b>Storytellers, you are free to use Peacats as background fluff!</b> I hope to one day add them to the STV along with other The Uncrucified-related story resources, but that's a long ways out still. Perhaps once that happens, toss a few bucks my way then once they've been properly statted, otherwise, have at and have fun!<br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.redd.it/c9r5r0phkz561.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-28T09:30:30-08:00","id":1430238,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Exalted Art Challenge Sketches - Demon</b></span><br /> <br /> I chose Mara the Shadow Lover and a particularly crafty Neomah for this topic! I've shown Mara in the great tree in Malfeas that serves as her home, along with a concept for the spiral she marks her disciples with.<br /> <br /> This particularly crafty Neomah appears in <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Uncrucified</a>, a sorceress and self-proclaimed artist practicing her craft in the dark parlors of Gem.<img src=\"https://cdna.artstation.com/p/assets/images/images/033/250/284/large/angela-sasser-1-1.jpg?1608916876\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-04T09:47:34-08:00","id":1431014,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>Exalted Art Challenge Sketches - Manses</b></span><br /> <br /> <br /> At the heart of the city of Dinas Rhydd lies the ruins of a great Solar manse complex where the campaign involving Kalara and her friends took place. Despite the war that had reduced the once-great city to rubble, the central control room remained a marvel of engineering and splendor. The day our band of disparate outcasts sat in the thrones of their Castes was the day that marked the beginning of the city's revival from its ashes.<br /> <br /> The Manse of Verdant Wyrm's Heart rises from atop a Wood-aspected demense. This great tree's roots produce a priceless green jade, while a bustling city has risen within its branches and in the shadow of its great canopy. The Heart is ruled by a powerful Outcaste Dragon Blooded Wood Aspect who has ruled for generations, providing his citizens with safety and wealth. This is yet another location invented by our Storyteller for a game revolving around Sidereal hopefuls preparing for their new destinies in the Celestial Bureaucracy.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EqLiuVWW4AM2AYo?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-06T08:41:18-08:00","id":1431291,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Exalted Art Challenge - Landmark &amp; Signature Character</b></span><br /> <br /> AHHH can't believe I'm almost done with this challenge! Only a few topics left now! <br /> <br /> This one's a 2 for 1 topic collection. First we have the harbor of Chiaroscuro with its famous dual lighthouses &amp; blue glass breakwaters. Kalara spent a lot of time overlooking this place during her time in the city as a slave.<br /> <br /> For Signature Character, we have <a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/meluran/art/Novia-690105289\" target=\"_blank\">Novia Claro</a>, a mysterious Night Caste. I don't know much about her, but I love her look and wanted to try my hand at drawing her.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EqRDOnWW4AIDWYH?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-17T09:05:23-08:00","id":1432515,"title":"","content":"The 2nd to last topic for the Exalted Art Challenge is &quot;Favorite Stunt&quot;. I decided to go Extra by doing a mini comic to show Kalara's stunt of initiating combat in the most rude way. In the climax of our campaign's first season, The Walker in Darkness invaded the town of our Circle of Solars by building a Shadowland right under their noses beneath the earth. After dueling his Deathknights, we were 'cordially invited' to dinner with Walker where this stunt began.<br /> <br /> Some WIPs of this comic's storyboards:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/481554431868141588/795891047813218334/unknown.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EreJlq5XIAAC3gx?format=png&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EreJnfOW8AAyicp?format=png&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EreJpFFW8AAEx1b?format=png&amp;name=medium\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-17T09:08:48-08:00","id":1432518,"title":"","content":"Another WIP of a style test with screentones using Clip Studio Paint:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Ery2jgTXUAAzAzO?format=jpg&amp;name=large\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> WIP of one side of the dinner table of Solars featuring Demi the Dawn Caste in her power armor and Night Locust the Night Caste sniffing the glass for poison.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/481554431868141588/799747746730606652/image0.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-16T10:13:51-08:00","id":1435666,"title":"","content":"Finally calling my try at the Exalted Art Challenge complete! You can see the entire set of images with links to each collection\u2019s lore and concept notes at the post. Lemme know what your fave topics were!<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>The collection post:</b></span><br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/art-collection-47395427\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.patreon.com/posts/art-collection-47395427<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/8ca3c796-5c30-4408-abd4-b74458ddd2a3/deeb242-8aadb6a5-a4c2-40d9-810d-ee031bf0a771.jpg/v1/fill/w_1280,h_960,q_75,strp/exalted_art_challenge_2020_collection_by_angelasasser_deeb242-